SOLUTION 1 DIC
    temp 20
    pH   7 charge
    C(4) 0.05  # mol/kgw
SOLUTION 2 Ca
    temp 20
    pH   7 charge
    Ca   0.05  # mol/kgw

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
SAVE solution 10

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step temp n_Ca_aq
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, TC, TOT("Ca")
